## 9. Chapter-level layout

Next zoom down to chapters.

Put chapter-level formatting here, including:

* chapter beginnings;
* chapter title pages where applicable;
* chapter headings;
* chapter-level navigation;
* chapter summary/title machinery;
* chapter-specific page behavior;
* other chapter-level layout/state.

Again, distinguish carefully between the reusable definition of a chapter and the content of a particular chapter.

