    hebrew_david = {
        tex = "HebrewDavidFont",
        script = "hebrew",
        default_scale = 1.22,
    },

    ...
}
```

The exact historical metadata need not be invented if it is not already represented in the project; the important fields are the ones required operationally.

This gives later source-profile data stable font IDs instead of requiring the whole architecture to be built out of dynamically named control sequences.

